hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2904","Narrated to us 'Abdul-Jabbar ibn al-'Ala', narrated to us Sufyan, who said: I heard Yahya ibn Sa'id say: I heard 'Amrah say: I heard 'A'ishah (RA) say:\n\When we were in Mina"","" I was brought some beef"","" so I asked"","" 'What is this?' They said"","" 'This is the meat of a cow that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) sacrificed on behalf of his wives with a cow.'\""\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""""
